  "designMd": {
    "raw": "# Rebates design system\n\nPremium, polished, editorial, and easy to understand. Paper, ink, hairlines. One accent.\n\n## Type\n- Voice: Switzer. Display 200, heading 300, body 400. Sentence case. Two tones: ink for the point, grey for the context. No bold for emphasis.\n- Lab note: Geist Mono 400, 10 to 12 px, capitals, tracking +6%. Data labels only.\n- Readout: Doto 600. One number per view. Never for words.\n\n## Color\nPaper #F7F5F2 page, card paper #F2EEE8, ink #1A1A1A, small text #55575D, large grey #686B72, hairline #E6E7E9. Ember #C65A2E is the one accent: tear line and errors only. Text in ember uses #96401C.\n\n## Controls\nPrimary: ink pill, 48 high, Switzer 15.5, one per view. Secondary: paper with hairline. Chosen: glass lens, not ink. Minimum touch size 44.\n\n## Signature\nOne paper ticket per member, torn at the middle. The member keeps everything above the perforation. The insurer gets only the stub below it.\n\n## Motion\nCard arrives 700 ms, 16 px rise, ease cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1). Lens 300 ms. Readout counts up 1.2 s. No bounce, spin, glow or scan effects.\n",
    "projectName": "Rebates design system",
    "colorPalette": [
      {
        "name": "Paper",
        "hex": "#F7F5F2",
        "role": "page, card paper #F2EEE8, ink #1A1A1A, small text #55575D, large grey #686B72, hairline #E6E7E9. Ember #C65A2E is the one accent: tear line and errors only. Text in ember uses #96401C."
      }
    ],
    "typography": {
      "scale": "- Voice: Switzer. Display 200, heading 300, body 400. Sentence case. Two tones: ink for the point, grey for the context. No bold for emphasis.\n- Lab note: Geist Mono 400, 10 to 12 px, capitals, tracking +6%. Data labels only.\n- Readout: Doto 600. One number per view. Never for words."
    },
    "componentStyles": "Primary: ink pill, 48 high, Switzer 15.5, one per view. Secondary: paper with hairline. Chosen: glass lens, not ink. Minimum touch size 44.\n\nOne paper ticket per member, torn at the middle. The member keeps everything above the perforation. The insurer gets only the stub below it.\n\nCard arrives 700 ms, 16 px rise, ease cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1). Lens 300 ms. Readout counts up 1.2 s. No bounce, spin, glow or scan effects."
  },
